<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TMS Dashboard — Kuzeyden Lojistik</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        * { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        body { background: #f8fafc; }
        .kpi { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; }
        .kpi-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .kpi-icon i { color: #fff; font-size: 17px; }
        .kpi-val { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1; }
        .kpi-lbl { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-top: 6px; }
        .kpi-sub { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 3px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex min-h-screen overflow-hidden">

<%- include('../sidebar', { currentPage: '/tms' }) %>

<main class="flex-1 ml-60 overflow-y-auto" style="max-height:100vh;">
    <div style="padding: 32px 40px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <div style="font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #0284c7; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px;">TMS</div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-top: 4px;">Operasyon Özeti</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px;">Sevkiyat, araç ve şoför verilerinin canlı görünümü.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 28px 40px 40px;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <div class="kpi">
                <div class="kpi-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0369a1);"><i class="fas fa-route"></i></div>
                <div class="kpi-val"><%= stats.toplam_sevkiyat || 0 %></div>
                <div class="kpi-lbl">Toplam Sevkiyat</div>
                <div class="kpi-sub"><%= stats.yoldaki || 0 %> tanesi yolda</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi">
                <div class="kpi-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);"><i class="fas fa-truck"></i></div>
                <div class="kpi-val"><%= stats.toplam_arac || 0 %></div>
                <div class="kpi-lbl">Araç</div>
                <div class="kpi-sub"><%= stats.musait_arac || 0 %> tanesi müsait</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi">
                <div class="kpi-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706);"><i class="fas fa-id-card"></i></div>
                <div class="kpi-val"><%= stats.toplam_sofor || 0 %></div>
                <div class="kpi-lbl">Şoför</div>
                <div class="kpi-sub">Tanımlı sürücüler</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi">
                <div class="kpi-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #7c3aed);"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
                <div class="kpi-val"><%= stats.toplam_musteri || 0 %></div>
                <div class="kpi-lbl">Müşteri</div>
                <div class="kpi-sub">Aktif iş ortakları</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; text-align: center;">
            <i class="fas fa-flask" style="font-size: 28px; color: #cbd5e1;"></i>
            <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; margin-top: 10px;">TMS modülü iskelete kuruldu.</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.5;">
                Sevkiyatlar, araçlar, şoförler ve müşteriler için tablolar hazır.<br>
                Şimdi her sayfayı tek tek kullanım akışına göre dolduracağız — sen ne ile başlamak istersen.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
